const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文在中国私有化经历的背景下研究政府所有权与公司表现的关系。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article investigates how government ownership relates to firm performance in the setting of China's privatization experience. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1468-5957.00422",label:{zh:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它使用有历史边界的所有权与私有化环境，所有权度量、公司样本和表现比较必须一并理解。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It uses a historically bounded ownership and privatization setting, requiring the ownership measure, firm sample, and performance comparison to be read together. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1468-5957.00422",label:{zh:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"可比分析需要带日期的所有权和控制、私有化与上市事件、公司财务、经营表现定义、股份类别和披露可得性。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"A comparable analysis needs dated ownership stakes and control, privatization and listing events, firm financials, operating-performance definitions, share classes, and disclosure availability. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1468-5957.00422",label:{zh:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"论文研究特定制度转型下的表现，不把国有或私有化对每家公司的影响标记为一致好坏。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The paper studies performance in a particular institutional transition; it does not label state ownership or privatization as uniformly good or bad for every firm. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1468-5957.00422",label:{zh:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留所有权和控制版本、事件日期、会计准则、合并范围、行业和选择规则，并区分期末与公开可得时点。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Retain ownership and control versions, event dates, accounting standards, consolidation scope, industry and selection rules, and distinguish fiscal period-end from public availability. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1468-5957.00422",label:{zh:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002)。中国历史私有化环境不证明当前所有权效应、治理评分或对某公司投资的结论。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002). China's historical privatization context does not establish present ownership effects, a governance score, or an investment conclusion for a named company. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1468-5957.00422",label:{zh:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Business Finance & Accounting (2002) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“How Does Government Ownership Affect Firm Performance? Evidence from China’s Privatization Experience”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。中国历史私有化环境不证明当前所有权效应、治理评分或对某公司投资的结论。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “How Does Government Ownership Affect Firm Performance? Evidence from China’s Privatization Experience”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
